From: CoreELEC Xiaomi SMB3 Multichannel laboratory
Subject: [EXPERIMENTAL MINIMAL-R1] cifs: try multichannel on non-DFS mount

Diagnostic-only patch.
Baseline R18 proves cifs_try_adding_channels() is not called when
CONFIG_CIFS_DFS_UPCALL=n. This variant mirrors the existing DFS-path
call in the non-DFS cifs_mount() path to prove causality.

--- a/fs/cifs/connect.c
+++ b/fs/cifs/connect.c
@@ -3614,6 +3614,11 @@
 			goto error;
 	}
 
+	/*
+	 * SMB3 multichannel is independent of DFS. Keep the non-DFS mount
+	 * path equivalent to the DFS path for this controlled experiment.
+	 */
+	cifs_try_adding_channels(cifs_sb, mnt_ctx.ses);
 	rc = mount_setup_tlink(cifs_sb, mnt_ctx.ses, mnt_ctx.tcon);
 	if (rc)
 		goto error;
